  "description": "These chocolate pancakes get their deep flavor from espresso powder. For a decadent breakfast, serve the pancakes with a luscious chocolate sauce.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: 1/2 to 1 teaspoon fine instant espresso powder (optional)\n\nNotes: Make sure to use regular cocoa powder in this recipe, not Dutch cocoa powder.\nMaple syrup or raspberry preserves are good substitutes for the chocolate sauce.\nTo keep the pancakes warm, tent them in foil or place them in an oven preheated to 300ºF (150ºC) until ready to serve.",
